	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2" >Just read through the posts.  Looks like they are claiming a cap of +1400 in +mana items.  Is it possible that there is a +mana item cap?  Wish I could test this, but don't have a int or wis caster above 50, hell I never got any of my chars to 50.<br />
